Chapter 3: Architecture Specification

3.1 System Overview: The Human-AI Cognitive Council

The HUMAN-4 architecture consists of four layers forming a Human-AI Cognitive Council:

```
┌─────────────────────┐
│  PLANETARY DIGITAL  │
