Caption: The four irreducible constraint dimensions represented as orthogonal axes. Each dimension corresponds to a block in the Jacobian matrix: Systemic Coupling (off-diagonal blocks), Environmental Feasibility (J₂₂), Technological Realizability (J₃₃), and Human Viability (J₄₄). The orthogonality illustrates that no dimension can be derived from the others.

